WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.301
What to carry forward.

2
00:00:01.581 --> 00:00:20.995
In the EU, general-purpose model duties have applied since August 2025 and became enforceable in August 2026; high-risk duties were pushed to late 2027 and 2028 by the 2026 Digital Omnibus; transparency duties apply now.

3
00:00:21.275 --> 00:00:27.653
Know whether you are a model provider, a system provider, or a deployer, because the duties follow the role.

4
00:00:27.933 --> 00:00:43.421
In the US, federal policy pushes toward preemption without a statute, while California’s SB 53 is in force and New York’s amended RAISE Act starts in January 2027, both aimed at the largest developers.

5
00:00:43.701 --> 00:00:53.664
For your team, the work is an inventory, disclosures, logs, documentation, and an incident process, built as engineering artifacts and checked like code.
